WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.833
This room doesn't exist yet. It began as
one

2
00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:05.367
sentence, from someone planning a build.

3
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.567
It came out of the drawing underneath. The
room you picture is the room you drew.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.933
One plan, dimensioned to the millimetre.
Walls that actually close.

5
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:38.200
Every room reachable. Every area exact.
Checked wall by wall.

6
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.667
And where it couldn't get something right,
it tells you, in writing, on the drawing.

7
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:59.333
Refine it by talking to it. Move a wall,
resize a room. Every edit is free.

8
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.533
Describe your home. Get a real,
dimensioned floor plan.

9
00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:24.367
Pay only when you get a plan worth
keeping.
